== the monitor, its clock from 2026-11-22T09:00:00Z, a collection every 30 seconds
09:00:00 monitor: started: 4 services, 2 watched paths, 7 rules
09:00:00 -- another monitor is started on the same configuration
09:00:00 $ monitor check --config demo.toml
           configuration demo: 4 services, 2 watched paths, a sensor, 7 rules
           start order: db, cache; then api; then web
           rules:
             temperature-high: avg(sensor.temperature, 2m0s) > 70 for 1m0s (critical)
             temperature-rising: slope(sensor.temperature, 3m0s) > 4 for 0s (warning)
             sensor-silent: age(sensor.temperature) > 90s for 0s (warning)
             service-down: service.*.up < 1 for 30s (critical)
             service-impaired: service.*.impaired > 0 for 30s (warning)
             cache-memory: service.cache.memory > 96MiB for 1m0s (warning)
             spool-full: watch.spool.bytes > 48KiB for 0s (warning)
           lock monitor-demo: held: a monitor runs this configuration
